          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "A9ojc9",
              "name": "Article",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "YED6Z",
                  "name": "Heading 2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "L0WZ2r",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#dde2f8ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "3. La primera ley: Hazlo obvio",
                      "lineHeight": 1.3333333333333333,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "tbHsx",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    16,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "If1G1",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "El cambio de comportamiento no se produce\nen el vacío. Está influenciado por el entorno\nque nos rodea. Por eso, la primera ley de la\nformación de hábitos es hacer que las\nseñales sean obvias.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "LbN4j",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NIrbT",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Las señales son los desencadenantes que\ninician nuestros hábitos. Cuanto más obvias\nsean estas señales, más probable será que\nactuemos.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "mZEU8",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "R91Wsr",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "No se trata de tener más motivación, sino de\ndiseñar tu entorno para que el buen\ncomportamiento sea casi inevitable.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "W8MeVZ",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "F7xdJ",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Por ejemplo, si quieres leer más, deja el libro\nen una mesa visible. Si quieres comer\nsaludable, ten comida saludable a la vista.\nPequeños cambios en lo obvio pueden\ngenerar grandes cambios en tu vida.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
